OL,3,GNEWSA'No one should feel afraid to go
OL,4,Ato work': How shoplifting is hitting
OL,5,Ahigh streets across England
OL,6,
OL,7,FA new BBC analysis of police data has
OL,8,Ffound 28,415 recorded offences were
OL,9,Flinked to just 270 suspects
OL,11,FRetail analyst Catherine Shuttleworth
OL,12,Fwarns the crime has become "totally
OL,13,Fnormalised", but Policing Minister
OL,14,FSarah Jones thinks progress is being
OL,15,Fmade
